{"id":"06de3c2036c1fe43","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-functional.md","title":"Functional","display":"df-functional — Functional","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-functional","aliases":["58-df-functional","Functional"],"display":"df-functional — Functional","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-functional"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-functional</span><span>Functional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-functional — Functional"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb k\">\\(\\mathbb k\\)</span>（标量域）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V,+_V,\\odot)\">\\((V,+_V,\\odot)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb k\">\\(\\mathbb k\\)</span>-向量空间，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbb k^V\">\\(f\\in\\mathbb k^V\\)</span>（标量值函数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb k}\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb k}\\)</span>（向量空间谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functional}_S\\subseteq\\mathbf V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Functional}_S\\subseteq\\mathbf V^3\\)</span>（此处定义的泛函谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functional} \\vdash \\mathrm{Functional}_S(f,V,\\mathbb k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_V,\\odot\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb k}(V,+_V,\\odot)\\land f\\in\\mathbb k^V\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functional} \\vdash \\mathrm{Functional}_S(f,V,\\mathbb k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_V,\\odot\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb k}(V,+_V,\\odot)\\land f\\in\\mathbb k^V\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>泛函只是向量空间上的标量值函数；线性、连续、凸性等是额外性质。</li>\n<li>线性泛函属于代数对偶；连续线性泛函才属于拓扑对偶。</li>\n<li>原文件中未量化的线性与半范数公式属于其他定义，已移出本原子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(V,+_V,\\odot)$（$\\mathbb k$-向量空间，见 [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb k","display":false},{"tex":"(V,+_V,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb k","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbb k^V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functional}_S\\subseteq\\mathbf V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functional} \\vdash \\mathrm{Functional}_S(f,V,\\mathbb k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_V,\\odot\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb k}(V,+_V,\\odot)\\land f\\in\\mathbb k^V\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1203,"backlinks":[{"id":"b5c14b388ec6d30c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-565","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-functional.md|58-df-functional]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["592f9cfb66a507c2","36d7463d215be751"]}